[h2]We need your feedback![/h2]

Please, complete a [url=https://forms.gle/6q59ETbcPFTgs6W49]short survey[/url] after playing. 
Current Demo contains the mechanics we have already added to the game. 

You can check out:
[list][*]Four created game levels;
[*]Dialogues with various characters;
[*]Global map mechanics;
[*]Puzzle solving;
[*]Some combat and enemies;
[*]Original soundtrack.[/list]
[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/41219646/64cd9602e6f60a77a2e99dc2aa0508d5f3f5f1a3.jpg[/img]

Beware of spoilers!

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/41219646/f0071470c995447c9faf7cc20e0ac96597a445d3.jpg[/img]

Due to the constant game improvement we still have plenty of things to work on:
[list][*]Proper character controller and animations;
[*]Role-playing mechanics, parameters and perks;
[*]Additional content entities;
[*]Proper UI/UX;
[*]Full gamepad support;
[*]and other stuff to help us create a great game! [/list]

We're open to your feedback and suggestions. Play the Demo, reach out to us through Discord or other Social media and do your share!

